			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 711140901,
					"content": "唉，还是先把翘英庄里的景取了吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140902,
						711140903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "邱老板"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140902,
					"content": "一切都还好吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140904
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711140904,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，派蒙，哎哟！托了你们的福，设备和画片一点没丢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "邱老板"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140905,
					"content": "不过，我们下次想要去那边取景，看来必须得去雇几个冒险家同行了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "邱老板"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140906,
					"content": "所以，你们那部关于茶的映影，到底拍得怎么样了呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140907,
					"content": "呃…这部片子处于…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "邱老板"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140908,
					"content": "有一个良好的开头。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140909
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兴晔"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140909,
					"content": "和一个良好的趋势。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弈丰"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140910,
					"content": "这不就是才刚开始拍吗？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140911
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711140911,
					"content": "哎呀，我们现在的资金…有点紧张，热塞尔先生的收费就和他的学问一样高超…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "邱老板"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140912,
					"content": "虽然我们也拍了几部小片，赚了几笔小钱，但这种大型记录映影，实在是太花钱了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "邱老板"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140913,
					"content": "特别是老板还拒绝了几家过来赞助的客商。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140914
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兴晔"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140914,
					"content": "和谢绝了一堆合作邀请。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140915
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弈丰"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140915,
					"content": "你们懂什么！这是为了我们能完全依照我们自己的审美，拍出一部好片。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140916
					],
					"speakerTitle": "邱老板"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140916,
					"content": "但是老板，我们最开始拍片的目的，不也是为了赚钱吗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140917
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兴晔"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140917,
					"content": "我…你、你们别管这么多，先去把设备支起来！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140918
					],
					"speakerTitle": "邱老板"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140918,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，这些报酬给你，多谢你帮我这么多次。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140919
					],
					"speakerTitle": "邱老板"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140919,
					"content": "等我拍出了好片，一定请你来看，然后再请你喝一顿好茶。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140920
					],
					"speakerTitle": "邱老板"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140920,
					"content": "弈丰，兴晔，找好光源角度！这次要一遍拍好！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140921
					],
					"speakerTitle": "邱老板"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140921,
					"content": "老板，这又不是拍人和人的对手戏…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140922
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兴晔"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140922,
					"content": "拍景物能不能一遍过，不都是全凭缘分嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140923
					],
					"speakerTitle": "弈丰"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140923,
					"content": "总…总之先把设备架起来！先…先在这等着！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "邱老板"
				},
				{
					"id": 711140903,
					"content": "看来你们没损失设备嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711140904
					]
				}
			]
		},
